$$


$$
\begin{aligned}
& \Rightarrow \frac{(3 K) A\left(\theta_2-\theta\right)}{d}=\frac{K A\left(\theta-\theta_1\right)}{3 d} \\\\
& \Rightarrow \quad 9\left(\theta_2-\theta\right)=\theta-\theta_1 \\\\
