$$

for adiabatic expansion :

PV<sup>$$\gamma$$</sup> = const.

$$ \Rightarrow $$ ln P + $$\gamma$$ln v = const.

$$ \Rightarrow $$ differentiating both sides;

${{dp} \over p} + \gamma {{dv} \over v} = 0$$

$$ \Rightarrow {{dp} \over p} =  - \gamma {{dv} \over V}$$

